---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: collections.groupPagesPaged
  size: 1
  alias: group
  addAllPagesToCollections: false
navView: home
permalink: "{{ group.pager.url }}"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ group.label | capitalize }}{% if group.pager.number > 1 %}, page {{ group.pager.number }}{% endif %}"
  description: "{{ group.description | safe if group.description else '' }}"
---
{#- A group's landing page (2026-11-03), one per group with a subject, tab
    or not, at the bare /<group>/. Flat: one scroll, no second menu beyond
    the views window — the same idea as a subject page one level up. The
    group says who it is, shows its cards where it has them, names its
    subjects when there's no shelf to find them on, then everything written
    about it, newest first. Every band hides until it has something in it. -#}
{%- from "cards.njk" import tile %}
<article class="tag group-page">
  {#- Past page 1 (2026-11-11) the header is the name, linked back to page
      1, and the page number; the cards and the subject row are page 1's. -#}
  {%- if group.pager.number > 1 %}
  <header class="tag-head group-head">
    <h1>{% if group.hasIcon %}<span class="mico m-{{ group.id }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}<a href="{{ group.pager.first }}">{{ group.label }}</a></h1>
    <p class="post-subdate">page {{ group.pager.number }}</p>
  </header>
  {%- else %}
  <header class="tag-head group-head">
    <h1>{% if group.hasIcon %}<span class="mico m-{{ group.id }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}{{ group.label }}</h1>
    {% if group.description %}<p class="tag-desc">{{ group.description }}</p>{% endif %}
  </header>

  {#- The group's note (2026-11-13): blurbs/groups/<id>.md, Hat on what the
      thing is to him, ahead of everything else on page 1. -#}
  {% if group.introHtml %}
  <section class="note-intro">{{ group.introHtml | safe }}</section>
  {% endif %}

  {#- The card band: sports' teams, one strip (the CSS keeps it to the row
      that fits). The canon strip, movies' shelf strip and the heading line
      of view links went on 2026-11-04: the views window under the nav
      holds those views on every group's pages. -#}
  {% if group.band %}
  <section class="group-band band-{{ group.band.kind }}">
    <h2 class="band-head"><span class="band-title">{{ group.band.title }}</span></h2>
    <ul class="shelf-grid band-strip shelf-{{ group.id }}">
      {% for item in group.band.items %}
      {{ tile(item, ("/s/" + item.subject + "/#" + item.anchor) if item.subject else false) }}
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {#- Several subjects and no shelf to browse them on (sports' leagues): the
      subjects as a word row, busiest first. -#}
  {% if group.subjectRow | length %}
  <p class="group-subjects">{% for s in group.subjectRow %}<a href="/s/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
  {% endif %}
  {%- endif %}

  {#- The log: every ## section about the group's subjects, newest first,
      one line each since 2026-11-13: the date, the subject, the section's
      first sentence, linking to the day; an essay is its title. The group
      page is the index, the subject page keeps the full replay (until then
      this was the view pages' timeline, every section in full — /sports/
      ran to 21 KB of posts under the cards). -#}
  {#- Marginalia (2026-11-13, after inktoblog.com/margin): each entry is the
      thing and Hat's note on it, in full, newest first. "Thoughts on:" and
      the link, the date (to the section in its daily), then the note. A
      section that didn't open on a link is the date and the note. -#}
  {% if group.layout == "marginalia" and group.stream | length %}
  <div class="margin-list">
    {% for entry in group.stream %}
    {% if entry.kind == "essay" %}
    <article class="margin-note">
      <p class="margin-source"><a href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.title }}</a> <span class="archive-kind">deep thoughts</span></p>
      <p class="margin-meta"><a class="fragment-date" href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.date | readableDate }}</a></p>
    </article>
    {% else %}
    <article class="margin-note">
      {% if entry.source %}<p class="margin-source">Thoughts on: <a href="{{ entry.source.url }}">{{ entry.source.titleHtml | safe }}</a> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></p>{% endif %}
      <p class="margin-meta"><a class="fragment-date" href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.date | readableDate }}</a></p>
      <div class="margin-body">{{ entry.noteHtml | safe }}</div>
    </article>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- set pager = group.pager %}
  {%- include "pager.njk" %}
  {% elif group.stream | length %}
  <ul class="essay-list line-log">
    {% for entry in group.stream %}
    {% if entry.kind == "essay" %}
    <li>
      <a class="line-date" href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.date | lineDate }}</a>
      <span class="sky sky-blank" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a class="line-essay" href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.title }}</a>
      <span class="archive-kind">deep thoughts</span>
    </li>
    {% else %}
    <li>
      <a class="line-date" href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.date | lineDate }}</a>
      <span class="sky" style="background-image:url({{ entry.subject.chipUrl }})" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a class="line-subject" href="/s/{{ entry.subject.slug }}/">{{ entry.face.title if entry.face else entry.subject.title }}</a>
      {% if entry.lede %}<a class="line-lede" href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.lede }}</a>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {%- set pager = group.pager %}
  {%- include "pager.njk" %}
  {% else %}
  <p class="empty">Nothing written yet.</p>
  {% endif %}
</article>
